The Halloween Voice is out! There are details in the YouTube community tab! Halloween Voice!

2353
02:11:56,708 --> 02:11:59,208
わしは色欲担当！
I'm in charge of "Lust"!

2354
02:11:59,708 --> 02:12:02,708
ハロウィンボイス聞いてほしいのじゃ。
I want you to listen to my Halloween Voice.

2355
